   "title": "A landslide-scarred band where the radar lost the ground",
   "text": "South of the Azuero-Soná fault rupture, a band from the south-west corner of the frame to the coast between Búcaro and Isla Cañas is decorrelated: coherence averages 0.2 and only about 7% of it is measured. The University of Panama's Institute of Geosciences counted 4,822 landslides in the epicentral zone.",
